OL,3,CGrooming cases to be 'urgently'
OL,4,Cidentified amid early release scheme
OL,5,Cconcerns
OL,7,FAndy Burnham's government is
OL,8,F"urgently" identifying any grooming
OL,9,Fgang perpetrators who may still be
OL,10,Feligible for early release from
OL,11,Fprison, amid concerns over a potential
OL,12,Floophole in the system.
OL,14,FThe Prime Minister has "personally
OL,15,Fintervened" to ensure "everything
OL,16,Fpossible is being done so that vile
OL,17,Fgroomers are dealt with in the way
OL,18,Ftheir victims deserve", a spokesperson
OL,19,Fsaid on Thursday.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@JO]vD@XOUwD@KO]wD@WOUzD@VO]
