FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786054681
OL,3,CGrooming cases to be 'urgently'
OL,4,Cidentified amid early release scheme
OL,5,Cconcerns
OL,7,FIn a statement on Thursday, a
OL,8,Fspokesperson for the prime minister
OL,9,Fsaid: "As part of the review of
OL,10,Fsentences, the prime minister asked
OL,11,Fthe Ministry of Justice to conduct an
OL,12,Fin-depth review of cases to ensure
OL,13,Fthat grooming cases were identified.
OL,15,F"This work is happening urgently. This
OL,16,Fis extremely important to the PM and
OL,17,Fhe has personally intervened to ensure
OL,18,Feverything possible is being done so
OL,19,Fthat vile groomers are dealt with in
OL,20,Fthe way their victims deserve."
OL,26,@qD@GOUwD@AOU|D@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
