PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786054681
OL,3,CGrooming cases to be 'urgently'
OL,4,Cidentified amid early release scheme
OL,5,Cconcerns
OL,7,F"The brave survivors have been put
OL,8,Fthrough hell by this process. They
OL,9,Fdeserve so much better."
OL,11,FThe scheme, which begins in October,
OL,12,Fhas been under scrutiny, as it could
OL,13,Fsee the early release of two of PC
OL,14,FAndrew Harper's killers.
OL,16,FJessie Cole and Albert Bowers could be
OL,17,Ffreed halfway through their 13-year
OL,18,Fsentences for manslaughter following
OL,19,Fthe officer's death in 2019.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@XO]
