PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786054681
OL,3,CGrooming cases to be 'urgently'
OL,4,Cidentified amid early release scheme
OL,5,Cconcerns
OL,7,FPC Harper sustained fatal injuries
OL,8,Fafter getting caught in a strap
OL,9,Fattached to the back of a car and
OL,10,Fbeing dragged down a country road as
OL,11,Fthe killers fled the scene of a quad
OL,12,Fbike theft in Sulhamstead, Berkshire.
OL,14,FThe driver of the vehicle, Henry Long,
OL,15,Freceived a 16-year sentence and will
OL,16,Fnot be eligible for release under the
OL,17,Fscheme.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
